frame.create {"spread": 1, "rect": [72.0, 90, 523.0, 400], "content": "text", "text": "On Hyperart: The Aesthetic Singularity Arrived First\nSandra Schipal\n\nConstruction draft, 2026. Not for sale. Chapters carrying [construction] flags are working text; see the repository for the live logbook and issues.\n\nSet in Georgia, typeset with DesignCraft. Plates are public domain, from the local painting archive; seven plates open their chapters. Credits in layout/plates8/CREDITS.md."}
